WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.646 line:85%
I was the first spacecraft to orbit an asteroid, and the first to land on one!

2
00:00:06.736 --> 00:00:08.240 line:85%
I'm NEAR Shoemaker.

3
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.370 line:85%
I launched in 1996.

4
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:19.400 line:85%
On Valentine's Day, February 14, 2000, I went into orbit around the asteroid Eros.

5
00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:25.258 line:85%
Every day, I studied it and took pictures: 160,000 of them!

6
00:00:25.348 --> 00:00:32.158 line:85%
Then, on February 12, 2001, my team gently set me down on its surface.

7
00:00:32.248 --> 00:00:37.991 line:85%
My last contact with Earth was on February 28, 2001.

8
00:00:38.081 --> 00:00:40.324 line:85%
What would you name your own asteroid?
